sequenceDiagram
  participant CEX as Exchange
  participant BA as Broker adapter
  participant WF as Application workflow
  participant DP as Domain policy
  participant Ledger as Inventory / accounting
  participant Store as Persistence port

  CEX->>BA: Market observation
  BA->>WF: Canonical observation
  WF->>DP: Evaluate current state and market facts
  DP-->>WF: Decision or refusal reason
  WF->>Ledger: Validate and reserve resources
  WF->>BA: Submit canonical order request via port
  BA->>CEX: Exchange-specific order request
  CEX-->>BA: Order acknowledgement / rejection
  BA-->>WF: Normalized order outcome
  Note over WF,Ledger: Acknowledgement is not an execution
  CEX->>BA: Actual fill event(s)
  BA->>WF: Canonical fill(s) with exact fee facts
  WF->>Ledger: Apply idempotently by stable fill identity
  Ledger->>Store: Persist state / ledger checkpoint
  WF->>DP: Re-evaluate only from reconciled facts
  DP-->>WF: Next decision or safe refusal